Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:35.95,Ameku-op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\k34}揭{\k34}穿{\k35}饰{\k34}作{\k35}雄{\k34}辩{\k35}的{\k34}谎{\k35}言{\an3}{\blur5}
