Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:07.49,Ameku-op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\k96}痛{\k13}く{\k48}て{\k46}も{\k20}(ひ{\k15}と{\k15}り{\k14}歩{\k15}い{\k19}て){\an7}{\blur5}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:10.18,Ameku-op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\k23}見{\k59}せ{\k38}な{\k15}い{\k35}よ{\k19}(涙{\k14}を{\k15}乾{\k14}か{\k15}し{\k19}て){\an7}{\blur5}
